MFEM mesh v1.0
#
# Curved test mesh for the Stage 1f end-to-end test hook_curved (test/CMakeLists.txt).
# The 4x4x4 hex box [0,1]^3 of exaconstit::MakeAutoHexMesh with ExaConstit's auto-mesh
# boundary attributes (1 bottom z = 0, 2 left x = 0, 3 front y = 0, 4 top, 5 right, 6 back),
# given order-2 Nodes (SetCurvature(2)) and then bulged: z -> z (1 + 0.2 sin(pi x) sin(pi y)),
# so the top face rises to z = 1.2 at its center (a genuinely curved mesh, the same bulge as
# test/microstructure/test_seeding.cpp CurvedBulgedMesh). Written once with Mesh::Print at 17
# significant digits.

#
# MFEM Geometry Types (see fem/geom.hpp):
#
# POINT       = 0
# SEGMENT     = 1
# TRIANGLE    = 2
# SQUARE      = 3
# TETRAHEDRON = 4
# CUBE        = 5
# PRISM       = 6
# PYRAMID     = 7
#

